==Description==
The '''GunSlinger Nametag''' is a nametag that was obtained from a [[Gunslinger Mini Plush]] code.

The '''GunSlinger Nametag''' has grey text and a black outline. Black and grey smoke appear from the nametag. Coins also appear from it.

